; claude: the music applications (CATALOG.md's Music section). Laid out
; like office/: the programs here, software/ for the golden frames, web/
; for the browser.
;
; So far TinyMinimoog, the Model D's voice (Minimoog_voice, over
; audio/'s blocks: plan_synth_teaching.md) played from the keyboard.
; What it might contain next, each Tiny and after a famous original:
;  - more synthesizers after the Minimoog: the TB-303 (a sequencer in
;    the audio clock), the DX7 (FM with six operators), the Juno
;    (polyphony, the chorus);
;  - a tracker (Ultimate Soundtracker 1987, ProTracker, FastTracker):
;    patterns of notes in columns, played by the audio library's mixer;
;  - a sequencer (Cubase, 1989): tracks of MIDI notes on a timeline, a
;    piano roll, audio/'s MIDI player;
;  - a sound editor (SoundEdit, Audacity): a waveform to cut, fade and
;    filter, audio/'s samples and Spectrum;
;  - a score editor (Finale, MuseScore): ABC in, staff notation out.
; Built on audio/ (synth, mixer, ABC, MIDI), gui/, and appkits/file_menu
; for their File menu.

; the synthesizers' voices, apart from their panels: the tests play
; them without a screen
(library
 (name music_voices)
 (wrapped false)
 (modules Minimoog_voice)
 (libraries audio))

(executables
  (names TinyMinimoog)
  (modules TinyMinimoog)
  (libraries
    elm_core
    elm_playground
    music_voices
    elm_playground_native ; implem of virtual elm_playground
  )
